<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sun west, rain, snow east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sun west, rain, snow east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Tuesday were forecast to see sun in the west, rain and snow in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sunny skies with highs of 5 to 22 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see rain or snow with highs of 0 to 16 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see rain or snow with highs of -5 to 8 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
